Package: voiceos-core
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-dbus-next, dbus, polkitd, pipewire, wireplumber
Recommends: orca, espeak-ng, speech-dispatcher, network-manager, btrfs-progs, snapper
Description: security-first voice control core for Debian
 VoiceOS provides an offline command router, typed action broker, trusted
 confirmation authority and Hermes Agent adapter for a voice-first GNOME
 desktop. This package is an early prototype and defaults to dry-run execution.
